      {
        "heading": "Step 5: save a traceable record batch",
        "text": "Accepted rows become a batch connected to the instance and date. Manual entry follows the same boundary: validate context, identify duplicates or conflicts, save rows, and preserve correction history. If a value is wrong, Mira corrects the source batch. She does not add another result to force analytics. Locked instances use correction or reopen decisions. Verifiable output: the batch contains intended players and values, and history explains corrections."
