        "text": "Draft is still being prepared. Saved means information was stored but may not be submitted or published. Submitted means it entered a review workflow. Reviewed means an authorized person assessed it. Published means the approved result is visible to its intended audience. Archived keeps historical content outside normal active views. Soft-deleted means removed from ordinary lists but potentially restorable by an authorized workflow."
