      {
        "heading": "Community roles",
        "text": "Alliance leader and co-leader manage an alliance scope when assigned. King or kingdom manager works across the assigned kingdom. Minister of Justice is a scoped community role used for relevant kingdom workflows. Knowledge author prepares content but does not necessarily have publication authority."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Product areas",
        "text": "Knowledge Hub contains guides and structured community content. Reading Verification records whether a reader submits the small fragment assigned within an article session. Lab is the group of simulators, optimizers, profiles, and reference data."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Related guides",
        "text": "- feature availability - access and navigation"
      },
      {
        "heading": "Distinctions that prevent mistakes",
        "text": "A template is reusable setup; an instance is its dated occurrence. A batch groups related input rows. Availability says whether an account can use a feature; permission says whether the current role can act on this record. Use the noun shown beside the record before correcting it. A locked event instance needs its authorized correction path; deleting an import artifact will not roll back its applied batch; a published article needs a new draft revision; and Kick will not soft-delete the player. When asking for help, name the entity, scope, date or version, and visible state so the responsible manager can open the same object."
      }
    ]
  },
